  "questions": {
    "fabric": "Is the thing ordinarily made mostly of cloth or fabric? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "bendy": "Can the thing ordinarily be bent or folded by hand without breaking? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "daily": "Do most people ordinarily use the thing on most days? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "metal": "Is the main body or structure of the thing ordinarily made of metal? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "unpowered": "Does the thing work without any electricity, battery or engine?",
    "handle": "Does the thing ordinarily have a handle you hold it by? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "nonelec": "Is the thing free of electronic components? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "heavy": "Does the thing ordinarily weigh more than 1 kilogram, about a bag of sugar? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "wearable": "Is the thing ordinarily worn on the body?",
    "cheap": "Can the thing ordinarily be bought new for less than 10 US dollars? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "liftable": "Can an adult ordinarily lift the thing with one hand? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "nonfood": "Is the thing something people do not ordinarily eat?",
    "nonmetal": "Is the main body or structure of the thing ordinarily made of something other than metal? Judge its everyday meaning.",
    "pocket": "Could the thing ordinarily fit inside a clothing pocket, even if people don't usually carry it there? Judge its everyday size.",
    "soft": "Is the thing ordinarily soft to the touch?",
    "breakable": "Would the thing ordinarily break or shatter if dropped on a hard floor? Judge its everyday meaning."
  },
